---
const RESUME_URL =
  "https://drive.google.com/file/d/10oqsUqzXLgK70DD2r6BfWbuYJLyKgWH0/view";
const GITHUB_URL = "https://github.com/Lucas-Dunker";
const GITHUB_USER = "Lucas-Dunker";
---

<section id="work" class="section">
  <div class="section-wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">02 / Work</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">What I make</h2>
    </div>

    <p class="section-lede reveal">
      No matter what, there's always something I'm building, testing, or
      tinkering with in my spare time. Between open-source work and freelance
      projects, my <a class="link-ink" href={GITHUB_URL}>GitHub</a> is the most honest
      changelog of what I'm up to. Like what you see?
      <a class="link-ink" href="mailto:lucasmd.dev@gmail.com"> Come say hi! </a>
    </p>
    <p class="section-lede reveal" data-delay="1">
      I've also heard there are a few secret subdomains hiding on this site, but
      you didn't hear that from me!
    </p>

    <div class="contrib reveal" data-delay="1">
      <span class="eyebrow">Contribution graph — last year on GitHub</span>
      <a
        href={GITHUB_URL}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="contrib-frame media"
        aria-label="My GitHub contribution graph"
      >
        <span class="media-loader">loading graph</span>
        <img
          class="contrib-img"
          src={`https://ghchart.rshah.org/1a1a1a/${GITHUB_USER}`}
          alt={`${GITHUB_USER} GitHub contribution graph`}
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="resume reveal" data-delay="2">
      <span class="eyebrow">Where I've worked</span>
      <div class="resume-actions">
        <a class="btn" href={RESUME_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          View résumé
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            width="15"
            height="15"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.8"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href={GITHUB_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contrib {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .contrib-frame {
    display: block;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--paper-soft);
    padding: 1.15rem 1.25rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .contrib-frame:hover {
    border-color: var(--ink);
  }
  .contrib-img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 560px;
    height: auto;
    /* one ink-colored graph, grayscaled; inverted in dark so it reads as
       light-on-dark and matches the notebook palette in both themes */
    filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.05);
  }
  :global(html.dark) .contrib-img {
    filter: grayscale(1) invert(1) contrast(1.05);
  }

  .resume {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .resume-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.15rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--paper);
    background: var(--ink);
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 9999px;
    transition:
      transform 0.15s ease,
      opacity 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .btn:active {
    transform: scale(0.97);
  }
  .btn.ghost {
    color: var(--ink);
    background: transparent;
  }
  .btn.ghost:hover {
    background: var(--paper-soft);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .contrib-frame {
      padding: 0.85rem;
    }
  }
</style>
